WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.840
Screech! A police car skidded to a stop outside the Grand Metro Tower.

2
00:00:05.841 --> 00:00:08.272
Detective Smith and Terrell got out.

3
00:00:08.273 --> 00:00:12.151
"I hope you know what you're doing, kid," Detective Smith said.

4
00:00:12.152 --> 00:00:16.639
Terrell held up crossed fingers. "Me too."

5
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:19.971
*** Roxy kept trying to break out of Black Spinneret's

6
00:00:19.972 --> 00:00:24.811
web. "There's no point in struggling," Black Spinneret

7
00:00:24.812 --> 00:00:28.909
said. "I'm going to bring you to my hideout in the

8
00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:34.156
subway. I'll keep you there forever." She laughed.

9
00:00:34.157 --> 00:00:38.475
"Unless Mayor Bloom pays me a million dollars.

10
00:00:38.476 --> 00:00:41.998
Then maybe I'll let you go!"

11
00:00:41.999 --> 00:00:45.090
Roxy was wrapped so tightly, she couldn't move.

12
00:00:45.091 --> 00:00:49.846
Suddenly— whiz-hoo! She shot her eye laser beams at the

13
00:00:49.847 --> 00:00:52.175
web. They sliced the thick

14
00:00:52.176 --> 00:00:55.479
strand. "Yes!" Roxy yelled as she broke out of the

15
00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:58.251
web. Black Spinneret's eyes flashed with

16
00:00:58.252 --> 00:01:01.170
anger. "You're not going to get away from

17
00:01:01.171 --> 00:01:04.474
me!" She hit Roxy with her

18
00:01:04.475 --> 00:01:07.108
legs. Roxy punched back hard and broke

19
00:01:07.109 --> 00:01:10.251
one. Then Black Spinneret slammed her other legs into

20
00:01:10.252 --> 00:01:14.959
Roxy. Bam! Roxy went flying and landed hard near the elevator

21
00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:17.270
doors. Ding! The doors

22
00:01:17.271 --> 00:01:20.023
opened. Terrell and Detective Smith stepped

23
00:01:20.024 --> 00:01:24.179
out. "Rocket Girl!" Terrell said. "What are you

24
00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:28.524
doing?" "Trying to stop Black Spinneret," Roxy

25
00:01:28.525 --> 00:01:32.263
mumbled. "This kid says he can help." Detective Smith shrugged.

26
00:01:32.264 --> 00:01:35.529
"He's some kind of science whiz."

27
00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:38.066
Terrell gave Roxy his project.

28
00:01:38.067 --> 00:01:40.586
"My device can block electrical signals.

29
00:01:40.587 --> 00:01:43.343
I think it could disable her spider legs."

30
00:01:43.344 --> 00:01:46.003
"It's worth a try," Roxy said.

31
00:01:46.004 --> 00:01:47.970
Terrell showed Roxy the switch.

32
00:01:47.971 --> 00:01:49.639
"Just flip it on.

33
00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:52.817
But wait until you're very close to her."

34
00:01:52.818 --> 00:01:55.117
"No problem," Roxy said.

35
00:01:55.118 --> 00:01:57.181
"Because here she comes!"

36
00:01:57.182 --> 00:01:59.833
Black Spinneret was rushing at Roxy.

37
00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:03.122
Roxy quickly flipped the switch.

38
00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:06.042
Two of Black Spinneret's legs swung around.

39
00:02:06.043 --> 00:02:10.899
Spiderweb splattered from her harness. "What's happening?"

40
00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.050
The villain tried to control her legs.

41
00:02:13.051 --> 00:02:15.717
But they were twisting and jerking wildly.

42
00:02:15.718 --> 00:02:18.431
One by one, the legs stopped moving.

43
00:02:18.432 --> 00:02:25.252
Black Spinneret crumpled to the ground. "My spider legs!"

44
00:02:25.253 --> 00:02:29.337
Pow! Roxy broke one spider leg and then another.

45
00:02:29.338 --> 00:02:33.116
"Your legs are busted, Black Spinneret."

46
00:02:33.117 --> 00:02:36.358
Roxy waved Detective Smith over.

47
00:02:36.359 --> 00:02:42.500
"And now so are you!" ***

48
00:02:42.501 --> 00:02:47.039
When Roxy returned to class, Terrell was entering the classroom too.

49
00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.346
"Terrell! You're back!" Mara said.

50
00:02:50.347 --> 00:02:53.505
"Did you win first prize?" Jack asked.

51
00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:58.055
"No," Terrell said. "I didn't even make it to the fair."

52
00:02:58.056 --> 00:03:00.916
He grinned. "But I did something better.

53
00:03:00.917 --> 00:03:05.342
I used my device to stop a villain!"

54
00:03:05.343 --> 00:03:09.768
"Wow," Roxy said. "You know who would be impressed?"

55
00:03:09.769 --> 00:03:11.684
"Who?" Terrell asked.

56
00:03:11.685 --> 00:03:18.820
Roxy smiled. "Rocket Girl!"

